{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_47229","headline":"武肃王有旨石桥设斋会进士一诗共六首 四 · 吴越僧","name":"武肃王有旨石桥设斋会进士一诗共六首 四","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"凌晨迎请倍精诚，亲散鲜花异处清。\n罗汉攀枝呈梵相，岩僧倚树现真形。\n神幡双出红霞动，宝塔全开白气生。\n都爲王心标意切，满空盈月瑞分明。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"吴越僧","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_47229.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_47229","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}